# The repository root IS the site, so everything here would otherwise be
# published. Keep the deployment to what a visitor should be able to reach.

# The retired site (was live on the Apache webspace until the move to Vercel).
# Kept in the repository as the source of record for the legal wording and for
# reference — but it must not be reachable, or a search engine would find a
# second, older copy of the same company under /old/.
old/

# Build and audit tooling, the local measuring server, and the internal notes.
tools/
prodserve.py
HANDOFF.md
CHANGELOG.md

# Design studies and parked experiments (the WebGL effects that were rolled
# back, the banderole mockup). Useful to keep, not meant to be served.
#
# The comparison pages are NOT in here - they live in preview/ and are served,
# because their whole job is to be looked at. Keeping them under _parked/ meant
# every link to them 404ed, which is exactly what "unter 03 sehe ich nichts zum
# aussuchen" was. A page nobody can open is not a page that was offered.
# preview/ carries noindex and a robots Disallow; take it out at go-live.
_parked/

# Der Audit-Befund. Getrackt, damit er zwischen den Maschinen reist - aber
# nichts davon gehoert auf die ausgelieferte Seite.
audit/

# Source material and screen recordings — large and never requested by a page.
assets-src/
*.mp4

# Local tooling state.
.mind/
.mcp.json
.recall/
node_modules/
